      "id": "msg_main0905_green_01",
      "hash": "31286df728b1b018",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「好，\\n由[VAR TRNAME(0000)]先來是吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_02",
      "hash": "312870f728b1b531",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接招吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0905_dummy_02",
      "hash": "3ce78b6f47fb37f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_03",
      "hash": "31286ff728b1b37e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「誰先來都行啦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_04",
      "hash": "312872f728b1b897",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「很好很好！\\n看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很有資格\\r\\n跟火箭隊對抗嘛！\\c\\n那西爾佛公司的事情\\n就交給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0905_red_03",
      "hash": "cf2dde7ee5ed07ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0905_sys_02",
      "hash": "b0a05f3c3ff2a7a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_05",
      "hash": "312871f728b1b6e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好啦！\\n接下來輪到[VAR TRNAME(0001)]了！\\c\\n繼續繼續！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0905_rival_01",
      "hash": "ab975143120cf9bd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0905_rival_02",
      "hash": "ab974e43120cf4a4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「呼……\\n光是用看的都讓我緊張死了……\\c\\n青綠哥的寶可夢們\\n眼神都好有氣勢啊！\\c\\n我也要努力加油！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就先走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0905_stafff_01",
      "hash": "0dd0da442d90e603",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "櫃台「青綠一向以\\n實力強大而出名……\\c\\n我看他好像沒怎麼\\n對你們放水呢。\\c\\n你們都好厲害！\\n希望你們真的能拯救西爾佛……！"
    }
  ],
